{
    "id":  3440,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Connector for COB + SMD LED Strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP20",
    "reference":  "90937-8-5",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eSolderless \u003cstrong\u003etransparent connector\u003c/strong\u003e for non-waterproof IP20 \u003cstrong\u003eCOB and SMD strips\u003c/strong\u003e with 8mm and 10mm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c/strong\u003e quick connector allows connections to be made on LED strips without the need for soldering by simply tightening the clips on the side of the connector. Super easy to fit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eConnector for COB and SMD LED Strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP20\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith our \u003cstrong\u003econnector\u003c/strong\u003e you can connect all types of \u003cstrong\u003e8mm and 10mm LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use it with your 8mm - 10mm LED strips:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor COB LED strips.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor SMD LED strips.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is very easy to install thanks to the quick click system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou have to take into account the dimensions of the connector if you want to insert it in an aluminium or polycarbonate profile.\u003c/p\u003e",
